    "text": "PanoWorld simplifies camera trajectories into translations via fixed headings for both current-action modeling and long-range memory.",
    "topic": "memory"
  },
  {
    "text": "PanoWorld employs Dense Panoramic Ray-Conditioning (DPRC) and Geometry-aware Memory Augmentation (GMA) to address long-range memory in panoramic world models.",
    "topic": "memory"
  },
  {
    "text": "A three-stage training pipeline is introduced to progressively optimize each component of PanoWorld.",
    "topic": "training pipeline"
  },
  {
    "text": "PanoWorld exploits the rotation-equivariant property of omnidirectional representations to treat rotation as an implicit geometric transformation.",
    "topic": "rotation-equivariance"
  },
  {
    "text": "Experiments on synthetic and real-world data demonstrate that MV-Forcing produces geometrically consistent multi-view videos of dynamic scenes at arbitrary lengths and viewpoint counts using a single few-step student model.",
    "topic": "MV-Forcing"
  }
